to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_90B_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20251120__20251120_zPRnLXrDU566"><span id="xdx_90C_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20251120__20251120_zYPh2MvVbkc"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-11-20" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000053" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2025-11-20" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000054" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#168;</ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></span></span></span>&#160;</p>

